id: pm-github-f1at
title: Fail-closed privacy gate for automated GitHub issue imports and one reusable sync workflow
description: "Automated fleet-wide sync is disabled because the pilot workflow pushes imported issue text to a public branch before any privacy gate inspects the proposed tracker diff. Add a fail-closed scanner over the proposed tracker change, wire it into import as --gate, and ship one reusable workflow_call sync workflow fleet repos can call."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:ci","area:gates","area:import","area:privacy",changelog-unreleased
created_at: "2026-10-05T06:09:58.912Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-06T11:50:22.874Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: pi-glm
acceptance_criteria: A fresh checkout installs the pinned extension and exercises a nonempty issue import; malicious issue-body credential and personal-data fixtures prevent any public branch push; completeness and idempotency are checked before mutation; a clean import opens a reviewable PR with permanent PM links; existing pilot workflows and future rollouts use one audited implementation or equivalent gate.
blocked_by: pm-github-9cjx
unblock_note: Final exact coverage and npm/Bun release checks are underway; PR 108 remains open for review.
dependencies[2]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-github-9cjx,blocked_by,"2026-10-05T08:43:10.230Z",codex-sol,"cli:update:blocked_by",detected
  pm-github-hptv,blocked_by,"2026-10-05T08:43:10.230Z",codex-sol,"cli:update:dep",detected
comments[25]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T06:21:37.672Z",pi-glm,"Design settled: new gate.ts holds the pure scanner (credential/personal-data/host-path rules over ADDED lines only, sha256 content-hash allowlist with required written justification, fail-closed on unreadable input/git failure/malformed allowlist); unified-diff parser with toon field attribution + jsonl patch-entry attribution; git collector covers staged+working+untracked under the resolved tracker path and excludes operational locks/extensions/checkpoints subpaths. Registered as 'pm github gate' (--diff, --allowlist) and composed into import via --gate: plan completeness + provenance idempotency verified pre-mutation, tracker-change scan post-write, non-zero exit so a workflow can never push on a finding. Reusable workflow_call sync workflow added with SHA-pinned actions; caller example at docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml."
  "2026-10-05T06:33:25.742Z",pi-glm,"Implementation checkpoint: gate.ts (scanner + unified-diff parser with toon/jsonl field attribution + git collector over staged/working/untracked tracker changes, operational locks/extensions/checkpoints excluded + sha256-keyed allowlist with required justification) is registered as 'pm github gate' and composed into import via --gate (plan completeness + provenance idempotency verified pre-mutation, fail-closed scan post-write, non-zero exit). Reusable workflow_call sync workflow with SHA-pinned actions + caller example added. Full package suite green: 347 tests pass, coverage 93.55 lines / 84.05 branches / 93.62 functions (repo thresholds 88/79/89 met), docstring gate 119/119, repo privacy gate clean over 3107 objects. New suites test/gate.test.ts (29) and test/import-gate.test.ts (13) include the adversarial full-sequence replay on a real git repo with a bare remote: token-in-body, token-in-comment, email, host-path, and high-entropy fixtures all fail the gated import before anything can be pushed, and the remote's ref list never gains the sync branch."
  "2026-10-05T06:42:46.064Z",codex-sol,"Resumed interrupted run as codex-sol. Preserving implementation commit and README draft. Verification priorities: scanner fail-closed inputs and redaction, full bare-remote sequence, SDK-resolved tracker paths, reusable workflow input safety and existing PR updates, real public issue acceptance, and requested all-source 100 percent coverage. Previous evidence met only the existing lower thresholds; this is not the requested coverage gate."
  "2026-10-05T06:44:15.604Z",codex-sol,"Verified inherited code with npm run typecheck, npm run docstring (119 declarations), and node --test test/gate.test.ts test/import-gate.test.ts (42 passed). Preserved README draft, removed host-path examples, and marked rollout references as release placeholders because the current published version predates the gate. Review identified staged-versus-working-tree and same-rule allowlist deduplication bypasses; fixes and regression tests follow."
  "2026-10-05T06:58:12.486Z",codex-sol,"Resumed verification found and fixed distinct-content allowlist suppression, staged-content omission, malformed/binary diff acceptance, unreadable optional allowlists, and escaped token/path parsing. Regression suite now passes 47 gate/import tests; lock tests passed in the prior focused run. Workflow now validates same-repository automated branch and exact version inputs through environment variables, imports comments, checks gate availability, verifies the second import has no filesystem changes, and uses a branch-specific force-with-lease. The inherited test commit contained a synthetic PEM header; retained exact-blob provenance documents that false positive without rewriting history."
  "2026-10-05T07:00:44.735Z",codex-sol,"Real public acceptance: a fresh scratch pm project installed pinned PM CLI 2026.10.4 and the packed pm-github candidate 2026.10.4. Read-only unbraind/pm-todos import planned 3 issues, imported 3 items, reconciled fetched/planned/skipped as 3/3/0, passed privacy scanning over 6 changed files with zero findings, and completed in 10.84 seconds. A second gated atomic import exited zero and left all tracker item/history bytes identical. No remote or push was used. Final candidate will be rerun with comments and native Bun before reporting completion."
  "2026-10-05T07:52:13.195Z",codex-sol,"Verified the actual reusable workflow shell sequence against a real git repository and bare remote: body token, comment token, email, and local-path fixtures prevent push and PR creation; clean imports create a PR and a fresh-checkout repeat updates it safely. Added a post-write provenance check that rejects stale completed SDK journals when persisted items are missing. Focused gate and workflow suite: 53 tests passed; final all-source coverage and native Bun checks are pending."
  "2026-10-05T08:03:34.543Z",codex-sol,"Final packed-candidate public acceptance in a fresh scratch PM project: read-only unbraind/pm-todos plan fetched/planned/skipped 3/3/0, first gated atomic import created 3 items, privacy verdict PASS over 6 files with zero findings, Node repeat exited zero with identical item/history bytes, native Bun repeat exited zero with identical bytes, and pinned CLI strict health passed. Runtime 68.69 seconds during concurrent verification; no remote configured or push performed. Separate with-comments acceptance correctly rejected personal email content before persistence. Native Bun focused suite now passes 53 tests with an explicit real-CLI timeout."
  "2026-10-05T08:08:23.784Z",codex-sol,"The canonical changelog generator defaults to closed items, while this work must remain open for orchestrator verification. Added a complete SDK read feeding pm-changelog and an explicit changelog-unreleased tag for this candidate only; other open claims stay excluded. The generated Unreleased section now links the feature without fabricating completion. Added regression coverage for staged operational files, nested tracker content, credential-bearing history pointers, and unused REST comment-user metadata."
  "2026-10-05T08:12:38.561Z",codex-sol,"Final workflow review found that GitHub runners do not inherit npm's local-bin PATH during standalone shell steps. The dependency step now publishes the checkout's local bin directory through GITHUB_PATH, and executable workflow fixtures prioritize that local CLI. This removes reliance on a globally installed pm executable in fresh-checkout imports. Public candidate receipts remain read-only; fleet callers require a future pinned feature release and audited caller adoption."
  "2026-10-05T08:16:55.234Z",codex-sol,"Verified Node and native Bun regressions for gated preview redaction in atomic and non-atomic modes, including imported credential-shaped titles and labels. Corrected launcher acceptance to invoke Node exactly as the package prepare hook declares; a Bun test runner must not silently substitute its own executable for an explicitly Node-based lifecycle hook. Final full suites are being rerun with these corrections."
  "2026-10-05T08:20:15.079Z",codex-sol,"Native Bun investigation reproduced a concrete subprocess issue: after changing PATH, spawnSync without an explicit environment still found gh; with an explicit current environment it correctly failed ENOENT. GitHub credential discovery, gh availability checks, and PM subprocesses now pass the current environment explicitly, preserving scoped authentication and CLI selection under Node and Bun. This was verified with credential-presence booleans only; no credential values were logged."
  "2026-10-05T08:28:56.085Z",codex-sol,"Frozen packed-candidate public receipt: fetched/planned/skipped 3/3/0, imported 3 items, Node second run exited zero and left item/history bytes identical, privacy PASS over 6 changed files with zero findings, pinned strict health passed, and no remote was configured. The direct native Bun CLI repeat remained active and was terminated; it left tracker bytes identical but has no passing exit/verdict. The entire bounded sequence took 312.01 seconds. This supersedes the earlier native-CLI positive receipt as the current acceptance boundary; native library tests remain separate evidence."
  "2026-10-05T08:33:17.927Z",codex-sol,"Expanded the explicit provider signatures to include Slack incoming-webhook credentials and OpenAI service-account keys, with syntactically shaped fake fixtures assembled at runtime. All gate findings still contain only rule, item id, field, and exact-content hash. These additions require a fresh final source-coverage receipt; no threshold or source exemption changed."
  "2026-10-05T08:43:11.660Z",codex-sol,"All 375 npm cases and all 375 native Bun cases passed in the full linked runs, but strict coverage failed and the Bun wrapper retained a deliberate failure exit code from operational-script fixture teardown. Corrected teardown to restore the previous numeric exit code, or zero when previously unset; the affected Bun files now exit zero without lowering assertions. The feature remains blocked by exact all-source coverage and the separate installed native CLI acceptance item."
  "2026-10-05T08:58:35.322Z",codex-sol,"Final frozen-source checks at 0b7c4ab: npm ran 375 tests with all passing; the full per-file native Bun linked test ran 375 cases and exited zero. Gate/import tests include 57 cases and actual workflow shell execution against bare remotes. Typecheck, strict erasable syntax, ESLint, 123 documented declarations, zero duplication across 12 authored modules, production audit, packing, attested-publish checks, generated changelog, pinned CLI strict health, and Git-object privacy passed. Mandatory 100/100/100/100 coverage remains blocked at 93.40/93.40/84.77/94.94. A latest direct public fetch retry timed out before planning or writing; preserve the earlier three-item Node receipt separately and keep native installed-CLI acceptance blocked."
  "2026-10-05T09:03:35.170Z",codex-sol,"Latest packed-candidate real-data acceptance recovered after the transient public API timeout: fresh scratch project with pinned CLI 2026.10.4 and the packed candidate planned/fetched/skipped 3/3/0 public unbraind/pm-todos issues, imported 3, passed privacy over 6 files with zero findings, completed a byte-identical Node repeat, and passed strict health in 12.28 seconds. No remote was configured and no push occurred. This is the final positive Node receipt; native installed-CLI acceptance remains separately bounded and tracked."
  "2026-10-05T09:11:07.592Z",codex-sol,"A current quota refresh reports Ollama Cloud, OpenCode Go, and Grok exhausted; Codex remains on pace within the weekly forecast. Started the updated Codex CLI with gpt-6.1-sol at xhigh to continue the existing exact all-source coverage task pm-github-9cjx. Thresholds remain 100 for all four metrics, no source ignores, and no release or rollout is authorized until the gate passes. The latest native installed-CLI repeat also passed in 4.22 seconds without tracker mutation; the earlier intermittent observation remains tracked."
  "2026-10-05T09:14:18.425Z",codex-sol,"Additional privacy review reproduced two missed shapes: a credential present only in a proposed tracker filename, and Windows drive paths using forward slashes. Both are now scanned. Filename findings use file_path and sensitive item identifiers are redacted. Real temporary Git regression tests prove a token-bearing filename fails without creating a commit; URL controls remain clean. The combined gate suite passes 40 Node cases."
  "2026-10-05T09:16:14.202Z",codex-sol,"The proposed-filename and Windows-separator fixes passed 40 Node gate cases and 40 native Bun gate cases. The newly linked two-case command ran through pm test with progress and exit zero. Strict typecheck, source and test ESLint, 123 documented declarations, and the complete 12-module zero-duplication gate pass. Final broad npm, Bun, coverage, and packed acceptance must be refreshed after the concurrent coverage work settles."
  "2026-10-05T09:22:58.633Z",codex-sol,"Further adversarial review reproduced camel-case accessToken/clientSecret assignments, Slack xapp and xoxc/xoxd credentials, and labelled unformatted phone data escaping the rules. The updated rules detect these shapes. Removed the date/UUID exemption because a credential assignment could deliberately include a date or use a UUID key; ordinary noncredential request ids stay clean. The combined gate battery passes 41 cases under Node and native Bun, with URL and machine-comment-id controls."
  "2026-10-05T09:31:11.763Z",codex-sol,"The actual reusable workflow shell now rejects nine independent malicious fixtures on real temporary Git repositories with bare remotes: body token, comment token, email, POSIX path, camel-case secret assignment, date-containing secret assignment, Slack app credential, labelled plain phone, and Windows forward-slash path. The linked gate/import suite completed with exit zero; every fixture verified the expected rule, redacted output, no item file, unchanged remote refs, and no PR receipt. Additional encoding review now rejects untracked NUL/UTF-16 content and invalid UTF-8 rather than silently scanning replacement bytes; 42 Node and native Bun gate cases pass."
  "2026-10-05T09:55:33.935Z",codex-sol,"Final source ae86e7d passed all 420 npm tests and all 420 native Bun tests with no skips. Exact all-source coverage remains blocked: 8099/8299 lines/statements (97.59 percent), 1859/2083 branches (89.24 percent), and all 200 functions (100 percent) across 12 authored modules; the failing gate removed LCOV. Projects planners reached 100 in all four metrics. Strict typecheck, ESLint, docstrings, zero source duplication, production audit, packing, pm-changelog, release-publish attestation, Git-object privacy, and pinned strict health passed. Latest packed real-data acceptance imported three public pm-todos issues, completed a byte-identical Node repeat, passed privacy over six files with zero findings, and passed strict health in 24.94 seconds; no remote or push. The direct native Bun CLI repeat timed out at 45.06 seconds with unchanged durable bytes, tracked separately in pm-github-hptv. Keep the candidate draft and the coverage/rollout follow-ups open."
  "2026-10-06T11:42:32.311Z",codex-sol,"Final continuation retains the audited gate and reusable caller implementation. Added real Git/PM/HTTP behavior coverage, a bounded installed-Bun process-group watchdog and reproducible dangling-lock wait-budget fix. Public all-state snapshot correctly refuses older email findings; the clean recent nonempty snapshot passes import, idempotent repeats and strict health without a remote. Source is now frozen for npm release:check and the full native Bun suite; no downstream sync workflow is enabled or dispatched."
  "2026-10-06T11:50:22.874Z",codex-sol,"Full npm run release:check PASS on frozen implementation: all 487 tests pass without skips and all 12 authored modules measure exact 100/100/100/100 (8391 lines/statements, 2218 branches, 208 functions). Typecheck, build, docstrings, lint, zero duplication, Git-object privacy, production dependency audit (zero vulnerabilities), package dry-run, changelog and publish attestation all pass. Pinned PM strict health with required merge drivers passes. Native Bun suite and Bun-invoked full release check remain in progress."
